          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.122,
            0.859,
            0.188
          ],
          "content": "**9. Tinku weighed 35.75 kg in January and 34.50 kg in February. Has he gained or lost weight? How much is the change? Ans:** He has lost weight. The change in the weight = 1.25 kg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.241,
            0.85,
            0.282
          ],
          "content": "10. Extend the pattern: 5.5, 6.4, 6.39, 7.29, 7.28, 8.18, 8.17, \\_\\_\\_\\_ **Ans:** 9.07, 9.06"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.299,
            0.646,
            0.319
          ],
          "content": "**11. How many millimeters make 1 kilometer?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.322,
            0.357,
            0.341
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** 1000000 mm"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.359,
            0.874,
            0.444
          ],
          "content": "**12. Indian Railways offers optional travel insurance for passengers who book e-tickets. It costs 45 paise per passenger. If 1 lakh people opt for insurance in a day, what is the total insurance fee paid?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.448,
            0.813,
            0.468
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** The total insurance fee paid for 1 lakh passengers is ₹45,000."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.484,
            0.398,
            0.503
          ],
          "content": "**13. Which is greater?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.213,
            0.505,
            0.368,
            0.541
          ],
          "content": "**(a)** $\\frac{10}{1000}   or   \\frac{1}{10}?$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.212,
            0.543,
            0.611,
            0.562
          ],
          "content": "**(b) One-hundredth or 90 thousandths?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.213,
            0.565,
            0.609,
            0.584
          ],
          "content": "**(c) One-thousandth or 90 hundredths?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.181,
            0.603,
            0.234,
            0.619
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.218,
            0.623,
            0.336,
            0.658
          ],
          "content": "(a) $\\frac { 1 } { 1 0 } > \\frac { 1 } { 1 0 0 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.217,
            0.66,
            0.572,
            0.678
          ],
          "content": "(b) 90 thousandths > One-hundredth"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.217,
            0.682,
            0.573,
            0.701
          ],
          "content": "(c) 90 hundredths > One-thousandth"
